=Mechanic=
*  Cost: %Minerals%30
*  [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 100
*  [[concepts/vehicle|Weight]]: 2
*  Base [[concepts/scanning range]]: 3
*  Can repair other vehicles/structures
This turret type can repair other structures and vehicles. It requires %Minerals% to initiate repair.

Unlike most vehicles, a sleeping mechanic does not wake up when given new jobs. Repair (and other) jobs are queued and start once you wake the mechanic up with the [[controls|sleep]] command.
